  "description": "We find Cheon-Hwa in a world beyond his own... There he will struggle to find his own purpose among the many inhabitants of the new world including elves, dwarves, and even mages! As we watch him grow in strength and spirit, the mangaka creates fascinating characters out of his companions and adversaries and moves past the simple concept of the antagonist vs the protagonist.\n\nTo find out what fate has in store for our hero, follow Id in a fantastic adventure, exploring a world where anything is possible! \n\n*Note: The story was left unfinished because the publishing house went bankrupt.*",
